Inserts each grocery item individually in a loop (typically 20-50 items per generated list):

```typescript
// apps/lambdas/ai-scheduler-lambda/src/pipeline/stages/aggregate.ts:262-287
for (const item of groceryItemsToInsert) {
  await db.insert(groceryItems).values({
    groceryListId,
    ingredientId: item.ingredientId === '' ? null : item.ingredientId,
    // ... 6 more fields
  })
}
```

**Fix:** Single bulk insert with Drizzle's array-values syntax:

```typescript
if (groceryListId && groceryItemsToInsert.length > 0) {
  await db.insert(groceryItems).values(
    groceryItemsToInsert.map((item) => ({
      groceryListId,
      ingredientId: item.ingredientId === '' ? null : item.ingredientId,
      ingredientName: item.ingredientName,
      quantity: String(item.quantity),
      unit: item.unit,
      status: 'NEED' as const,
      estimatedCost: item.estimatedCost === null ? null : String(item.estimatedCost),
      storeSection: assignStoreSection(item.category, item.ingredientName) as StoreSection,
    })),
  )
}
```

Reduces 30+ queries to 1 per pipeline run.

